<title>USA: Boca Research names Ferguson chairman.</title>
<headline>Boca Research names Ferguson chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boca Research Inc said Wednesday it had named Robert Ferguson chairman of its board.</p>
<p>He succeeds E. Roe Stamps.</p>
<p>Ferguson became a director of the company shortly after Boca Research's initial public stock offering in 1993.</p>
<p>He has been president of Robert W. Ferguson and Associates, a consulting and investment firm.</p>
</text>
